      "text_raw": "Now that we know that a\ncascode enhances the gain\nconsiderably, we would like\nto know up tol what fre-\nquencies, a cascode manages\nto do this.\nWhen the output capaci-\ntance is the main capaci-\ntance, the GBW is as given\nin this slide.\nThe Bandwidth for both\ncases must be different, as\nthe output resistances differ\nwidely.\nThe GBW is the same for\nboth, however.\nIndeed, in the case with a cascode, the gain is much larger but the bandwidth is equally lower.\nThe GBW is thus the same. This is shown next.",
      "text": "Now that we know that a cascode enhances the gain considerably, we would like to know up tol what frequencies, a cascode manages to do this. When the output capacitance is the main capacitance, the GBW is as given in this slide. The Bandwidth for both cases must be different, as the output resistances differ widely. The GBW is the same for both, however. Indeed, in the case with a cascode, the gain is much larger but the bandwidth is equally lower. The GBW is thus the same. This is shown next."
